🎯 For a tutorial / workshop
You want:

enough training data to learn meaningful structure

small enough files for GitHub + Colab

stable validation metrics

Recommended split given size constraints:
Split	Fraction	Rationale
Train	70–80% of kept data	Maximize learning
Val	10–15%	Stable metrics
Test	10–15%	Honest evaluation
If you reduce total samples, keep this ratio.

🧠 Counterintuitive but true
A model trained on 40k samples with 5k val
is better than one trained on 30k samples with 15k val

Validation beyond ~5–10k events gives diminishing returns.

